# Models folder (symlink to life-matters-models/models, not tracked). Anchored to repo
# root — an unanchored `models/` also matched `test_verification/models/` (the
# numeric regression test suite, named test_verify/ until 2026-07-21) at any
# depth, silently keeping it out of git entirely since it was first added
# (2026-06-19). Discovered 2026-07-10 while adding new tests there.
/models/

# CLI outputs (folder tracked, contents ignored)
output/*
!output/.gitkeep
